<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 29.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 29.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines reported by Kuku Raadio on Thursday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Of every 1,000 children born in Estonia 15 die in the first year. This is only exceeded by Romania, Moldova and Latvia, Eesti Ekspress reported.</p>
<p>- People can from today make a donation for the construction of a new freedom monument to be located on Freedom Square.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
